= Hello from node two
This document arrived in a custom binary YNP frame.
:: Experimental network
  TCP is restricted to numeric loopback addresses.
  Traffic is plaintext and unauthenticated. Do not send sensitive data.
  > ynp://127.0.0.1:7301/welcome | Return to the first node
